{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"There’s a useful ambiguity in the pair-content gain: the two fields defining each match repeat known target embeddings, while the remaining fields and action can carry other event information. I’ll implement a four-cell comparison that varies which of those two parts uses same-event content, keeping counts, capacity, tokens, and the training recipe fixed."}}
